        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Deanonymization attack research",
          "why": "A full analysis of deanonymization vectors and a researcher pivoting from Zcash to audit Monero's cryptography raised genuine doubt about whether ring-signature privacy survives modern traffic analysis and AI-assisted audits."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Macro hedge and 'digital silver' narrative",
